WEBVTT

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:19.144
Okay.

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:23.774
Chloe...

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.318
An ironed shirt.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:28.445
A jacket that's not baggy.

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:30.447
Shiny shoes.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:32.616
This is so unlike you!

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.077
So unlike the bumbling Leon!

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.788
I-- I was thinking about going out.

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:38.997
Where?

00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:41.166
Well, about that... It's...

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.709
you know...

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:46.505
Family Contract, Article 7.
"Say where you're going when you go out!"

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.466
You'd better spill it.

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:51.760
Well, you see...

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:52.844
Sorry!

00:00:53.095 --> 00:00:54.096
Hey, Leon!

00:00:56.265 --> 00:00:57.683
This is fishy.

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:01.937
The eastern sky.

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.190
Pure white doves.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.611
It calls to me...

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:12.072
Chaos.

00:02:43.914 --> 00:02:47.751
The Phantom Panda

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:55.717
Should I start with an unknown place
or a famous one?

00:02:56.927 --> 00:02:58.095
Wow!

00:02:58.303 --> 00:03:01.723
-Look over there!
-Look, isn't that where our house is?

00:03:01.807 --> 00:03:02.808
Chloe...

00:03:02.891 --> 00:03:05.769
-Don't be stupid. We can't see it.
-I wonder if she's mad.

00:03:06.478 --> 00:03:07.604
Really?

00:03:14.069 --> 00:03:15.070
What was...

00:03:15.404 --> 00:03:16.405
What's wrong?

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.782
I saw someone on the wall.

00:03:19.241 --> 00:03:21.743
Maybe you're just hallucinating
from lack of sleep.

00:03:21.827 --> 00:03:22.911
That could be...

00:03:24.121 --> 00:03:26.456
Wait, Chloe?!
Why are you here?

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:28.625
Huh? Well, you see,

00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:32.045
I finally got a day off,
so I thought I'd go shopping.

00:03:32.212 --> 00:03:33.130
Alone?

00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:34.714
Don't be silly.

00:03:36.675 --> 00:03:38.301
PORCELAIN PORT

00:03:38.385 --> 00:03:42.806
LONGYIN GATE

00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:45.892
Oh, wow!

00:03:47.185 --> 00:03:48.186
Oh, wow!

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:49.855
CHEN MAHUA

00:03:49.938 --> 00:03:51.022
Oh, wow!

00:03:52.315 --> 00:03:54.109
<i>What? This way?</i>

00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:55.986
<i>Or maybe this way?</i>

00:03:57.529 --> 00:03:59.114
Is that where you're meeting?

00:03:59.656 --> 00:04:00.866
Something like that.

00:04:01.283 --> 00:04:02.451
I'm out of time, too.

00:04:04.995 --> 00:04:06.371
It's not like that!

00:04:06.621 --> 00:04:09.166
I'm just
trying to figure out which way...

00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:12.669
I knew it was something like that.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.505
You can't get there on your own, can you?

00:04:15.797 --> 00:04:18.675
But today, I need to do this alone.

00:04:18.759 --> 00:04:21.470
-Why?
-Well, you see... Ouch.

00:04:22.012 --> 00:04:23.430
Chloe! Wait!

00:04:23.513 --> 00:04:25.474
Quit being a lazy bumbler!

00:04:26.683 --> 00:04:27.934
Family.

00:04:28.852 --> 00:04:30.687
Transitory ties.

00:04:33.648 --> 00:04:34.649
I made it in time.

00:04:40.906 --> 00:04:44.326
Salt grilled is just the best way
to have BRAI bats.

00:04:46.328 --> 00:04:47.329
You don't want any?

00:04:47.662 --> 00:04:51.166
If I had to come here,
I'd rather it be with a lovely lady.

00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:54.336
Don't you worry. These are all females.

00:04:54.669 --> 00:04:57.255
Torn from your boyfriend
and cooked up like this?

00:04:57.631 --> 00:04:59.841
I feel your pain, ladies.

00:05:01.551 --> 00:05:02.552
By the way,

00:05:02.761 --> 00:05:05.472
have you gotten used to
living in Neo Xianglong?

00:05:05.639 --> 00:05:09.184
At the very least,
Emilia seems to be comfortable here.

00:05:09.351 --> 00:05:11.102
Let me know if you need anything.

00:05:11.603 --> 00:05:14.022
If you're feeling down,
I can always give you a--

00:05:14.147 --> 00:05:15.607
Anything but that.

00:05:21.571 --> 00:05:25.033
Then you get ten times
the Japanese pepper on your BRAI bats.

00:05:25.325 --> 00:05:27.077
I didn't mean anything.

00:05:28.119 --> 00:05:29.120
A lingering vision.

00:05:31.498 --> 00:05:32.499
A spell.

00:05:35.544 --> 00:05:36.878
Say "ah."

00:05:36.962 --> 00:05:38.380
-Let's come here again.
-Sure.

00:05:40.715 --> 00:05:43.343
Every last one of them
is just slacking off!

00:05:45.011 --> 00:05:46.012
Envy.

00:05:47.055 --> 00:05:48.056
Pride.

00:05:51.518 --> 00:05:52.561
Excuse me.

00:05:56.147 --> 00:05:57.148
Same as ever.

00:05:59.734 --> 00:06:02.279
Nobody likes a man who complains too much.

00:06:06.491 --> 00:06:09.411
Regarding your request,
everything is ready.

00:06:10.787 --> 00:06:11.788
I see.

00:06:23.091 --> 00:06:24.801
Expensive-looking shoes.

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:27.846
Expensive-looking teapots.

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:31.057
Expensive-looking jewelry.

00:06:33.351 --> 00:06:35.478
Are you looking for something, sir?

00:06:36.187 --> 00:06:37.856
No, I'm just looking.

00:06:38.023 --> 00:06:39.816
I recommend this one.

00:06:40.191 --> 00:06:41.776
A bracelet like this--

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.654
-Could you leave me be?
-He really seems to be in love.

00:06:45.113 --> 00:06:46.948
Then how about this ring?

00:06:47.032 --> 00:06:48.325
Black and white?

00:06:48.408 --> 00:06:52.078
-It comes in pink and orange.
-I think I would choose this one.

00:06:52.329 --> 00:06:53.747
Those are moonstones.

00:06:57.042 --> 00:06:59.919
Stones that deepen the bonds
with the person you love.

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:03.340
The person you love?

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:04.841
Are they for your sister?

00:07:05.884 --> 00:07:07.302
Well, no.

00:07:07.427 --> 00:07:09.012
What do I do?

00:07:09.554 --> 00:07:11.890
Then, how about this color?

00:07:11.973 --> 00:07:14.017
Please, just leave me alo--

00:07:16.061 --> 00:07:17.479
Am I imagining things?

00:07:17.938 --> 00:07:18.939
Hey.

00:07:19.022 --> 00:07:20.607
Don't you think this is cute?

00:07:24.277 --> 00:07:26.279
Yeah, this would look pretty nice.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.074
Really? It would?

00:07:29.699 --> 00:07:32.285
I wonder what kind of person she is.

00:07:32.744 --> 00:07:33.828
What do you mean?

00:07:35.497 --> 00:07:36.873
You still won't say.

00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:41.544
Wait! That's right!
I have to hurry!

00:07:43.296 --> 00:07:44.381
Ow, ow, ow!

00:07:45.006 --> 00:07:46.257
Wh-- What was that for?

00:07:46.341 --> 00:07:48.301
Family Contract, Article 6.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:50.303
"No keeping secrets!"

00:07:52.389 --> 00:07:53.390
Wait--!

00:07:55.558 --> 00:07:59.062
Contract violation. Contract violation.
Contract violation!

00:08:03.233 --> 00:08:04.526
Leon, you dummy.

00:08:15.787 --> 00:08:16.871
How cute.

00:08:18.581 --> 00:08:20.375
Release your hidden desires.

00:08:25.672 --> 00:08:27.757
I knew this was it.

00:08:27.966 --> 00:08:28.842
Chloe?

00:08:29.134 --> 00:08:30.260
What are you doing here?

00:08:31.261 --> 00:08:33.430
No, this is...

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.851
The artisan's skill just really
spoke to me as a martial artist.

00:08:37.934 --> 00:08:39.185
Hmm?

00:08:39.269 --> 00:08:40.603
Wh-- What?

00:08:40.937 --> 00:08:42.147
Oh, nothing.

00:08:43.023 --> 00:08:45.567
Queenie, are you here shopping today?

00:08:45.817 --> 00:08:48.528
-Or are you--
-W-- Well, actually, you see...

00:08:48.945 --> 00:08:50.655
I know! Want some cotton candy?

00:08:50.905 --> 00:08:52.449
It's really cute! See?

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.243
This is fishy.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.917
The quantum reading fluctuations
are really strong.

00:09:07.839 --> 00:09:09.799
This really isn't my thing.

00:09:11.593 --> 00:09:13.344
I'm sorry, Chloe.

00:09:17.599 --> 00:09:18.808
You came here with Leon?

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:20.769
Well, yes.

00:09:21.603 --> 00:09:24.022
What is that guy thinking?

00:09:24.272 --> 00:09:28.109
I think it's too soon
for that kind of thing with Leon!

00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:31.237
He's grown, but he needs
to be looked after like a child.

00:09:31.571 --> 00:09:33.615
He's completely hopeless without me!

00:09:34.324 --> 00:09:35.325
I know.

00:09:35.617 --> 00:09:39.037
<i>He was having trouble</i>
<i>finding the restroom the other day.</i>

00:09:39.621 --> 00:09:42.999
<i>He's always drooling</i>
<i>when he sleeps in the briefing room.</i>

00:09:44.042 --> 00:09:47.879
<i>Also, he's never comfortable</i>
<i>unless he's snacking on something.</i>

00:09:48.213 --> 00:09:49.839
<i>That's going a bit far.</i>

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.218
But, when the chips are down,
he comes through.

00:09:54.594 --> 00:09:55.762
Thanks to him,

00:09:56.221 --> 00:09:58.431
I've been able
to come to terms with myself.

00:09:59.182 --> 00:10:00.934
I'm very grateful to him.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:04.771
What's wrong?

00:10:05.188 --> 00:10:06.106
But...

00:10:07.732 --> 00:10:08.942
<i>that's how I feel, too...</i>

00:10:16.074 --> 00:10:18.618
At any rate, time for kids to go home.

00:10:20.662 --> 00:10:21.663
Okay!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.167
I'll lend you two a hand!

00:10:30.547 --> 00:10:32.257
The readings are coming from here.

00:10:40.974 --> 00:10:41.975
Wait!

00:11:22.390 --> 00:11:23.725
Who are you?

00:11:25.643 --> 00:11:26.853
Took you long enough,

00:11:27.562 --> 00:11:28.563
Leon Lau.

00:11:30.773 --> 00:11:32.108
How do you know my name?

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:34.611
You see...

00:11:40.575 --> 00:11:41.659
I've been waiting...

00:11:46.080 --> 00:11:47.081
for you.

00:11:51.544 --> 00:11:54.422
This town is as crowded as ever.

00:11:55.131 --> 00:11:57.717
This is where the jobs are, after all.

00:11:58.843 --> 00:12:01.512
It's a completely different world
outside the walls.

00:12:02.931 --> 00:12:06.643
You said you've done
a fair bit of traveling.

00:12:07.685 --> 00:12:11.230
I guess with your skill,
you'd never have trouble getting work.

00:12:11.689 --> 00:12:13.775
What's this?
You're showing interest in me?

00:12:13.858 --> 00:12:15.985
Don't tell me you're trying to woo me.

00:12:16.611 --> 00:12:17.737
What about you?

00:12:17.820 --> 00:12:21.032
How long do you plan
on doing this work in your condition?

00:12:23.242 --> 00:12:25.370
<i>So, you noticed.</i>

00:12:26.621 --> 00:12:28.498
You said you were a mercenary, right?

00:12:28.873 --> 00:12:29.958
Is it from back then?

00:12:30.291 --> 00:12:34.587
Yeah. It was boring work, mostly security.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:40.551
<i>In a stinking hot desert,</i>
<i>I spotted a sniper.</i>

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:43.972
<i>But the next moment, he nailed me.</i>

00:12:44.555 --> 00:12:47.141
<i>The client lost his life</i>
<i>with a single shot.</i>

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:51.270
<i>I still don't understand it, though.</i>

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.566
<i>Why didn't the sniper finish me off?</i>

00:12:56.859 --> 00:13:00.363
<i>He probably didn't think you would</i>
<i>bring in any money if he killed you.</i>

00:13:01.823 --> 00:13:02.949
Maybe you're right.

00:13:06.244 --> 00:13:08.579
Well, it doesn't matter to me, though.

00:13:08.913 --> 00:13:09.914
Where you going?

00:13:10.581 --> 00:13:11.624
Don't you worry.

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:14.085
I'll earn my pay.

00:13:17.422 --> 00:13:21.009
OLD TOWN CHICKEN GIBLETS
SPICY CHICKEN

00:13:23.928 --> 00:13:26.806
I still can't get info
on where the deal will take place.

00:13:27.640 --> 00:13:29.058
They're having a tough time.

00:13:29.642 --> 00:13:30.643
I see.

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:36.190
Also, the person known as Mr. Gold
has met with forces opposed to the Mayor.

00:13:36.607 --> 00:13:38.693
I believe they're planning a secret deal.

00:13:39.444 --> 00:13:41.070
Mr. Gold...

00:13:42.238 --> 00:13:45.783
Recently, his name has been coming up
in underworld circles.

00:13:46.242 --> 00:13:47.785
But his real identity is unknown.

00:13:50.329 --> 00:13:53.458
We also have info that an assassin
has infiltrated the city.

00:13:54.167 --> 00:13:55.334
Please take care.

00:13:56.419 --> 00:13:57.712
As always.

00:14:01.591 --> 00:14:05.053
Let's get this over with,
so I can go drinking.

00:14:17.774 --> 00:14:18.691
I've been waiting

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.818
so, so long...

00:14:21.569 --> 00:14:22.570
for you.

00:14:25.573 --> 00:14:28.951
I've detected multidimensional
quantum fluctuations coming from you.

00:14:29.285 --> 00:14:31.412
I know this is where the deal will happen.

00:14:31.871 --> 00:14:33.873
What the heck are you planning?

00:14:34.582 --> 00:14:35.583
You want to know?

00:14:36.125 --> 00:14:37.126
Yes.

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:38.211
Are you sure?

00:14:38.294 --> 00:14:39.295
Of course!

00:14:39.879 --> 00:14:41.589
Then you're it.

00:14:41.672 --> 00:14:42.673
What?

00:14:43.049 --> 00:14:44.258
Catch me!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.187
What are you?

00:14:57.271 --> 00:14:58.481
I am Fiona.

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:01.609
You are Leon.

00:15:05.405 --> 00:15:06.739
Open your ears.

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:14.831
A lingering vision.

00:15:15.164 --> 00:15:16.165
A spell.

00:15:16.666 --> 00:15:17.667
Envy.

00:15:18.167 --> 00:15:19.168
Release.

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:20.711
Madness.

00:15:21.546 --> 00:15:24.006
This world is always full of voices.

00:15:24.382 --> 00:15:25.216
Voices?

00:15:27.593 --> 00:15:29.053
What do you mean voices?

00:15:29.595 --> 00:15:30.596
You want to know?

00:15:32.598 --> 00:15:34.267
What will they tell me?

00:15:35.017 --> 00:15:36.018
You want to know?

00:15:38.521 --> 00:15:39.522
<i>You want to know?</i>

00:15:40.064 --> 00:15:41.149
<i>You want to know?</i>

00:15:46.195 --> 00:15:48.072
-You want to know?
-Ouch...

00:15:51.868 --> 00:15:52.869
Fiona,

00:15:53.202 --> 00:15:54.203
what...

00:15:54.787 --> 00:15:55.788
are you?

00:15:56.122 --> 00:15:59.625
You want to know?

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:02.211
I want to know!

00:16:05.882 --> 00:16:07.049
Quantum power

00:16:07.133 --> 00:16:10.386
affects the deep consciousness
by utilizing multiple dimensions.

00:16:11.429 --> 00:16:13.598
Most of her are illusions.

00:16:14.474 --> 00:16:16.934
<i>If I collect and observe</i>
<i>all her patterns so far,</i>

00:16:17.310 --> 00:16:19.145
<i>and examine the possibilities...</i>

00:16:26.736 --> 00:16:27.904
I've got you!

00:16:31.115 --> 00:16:32.366
You caught me.

00:16:34.577 --> 00:16:36.078
You're the second one, Leon.

00:16:36.537 --> 00:16:37.538
What?

00:16:37.622 --> 00:16:39.999
CHINESE MEDICINE

00:16:40.583 --> 00:16:41.584
Welcome.

00:16:43.503 --> 00:16:45.213
Haven't seen your face in a while.

00:16:47.006 --> 00:16:48.382
What did you come here for?

00:16:50.843 --> 00:16:54.305
Oh, wow! You're totally cute!

00:16:57.433 --> 00:16:59.602
I-- I put it on as promised.

00:16:59.852 --> 00:17:02.104
Now do as you said, and go home!

00:17:06.442 --> 00:17:09.153
Okay. I'm sure Leon will like it.

00:17:12.073 --> 00:17:13.699
NEKOMUSUME RESTAURANT

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:16.577
You found it? How?

00:17:17.286 --> 00:17:19.372
Damn it! They beat me to it!

00:17:20.206 --> 00:17:21.207
Don't you move.

00:17:21.624 --> 00:17:22.959
This mission is top-secret.

00:17:23.751 --> 00:17:24.752
What?

00:17:25.461 --> 00:17:26.462
A mission?

00:17:30.758 --> 00:17:32.677
Yeah, I know,

00:17:32.927 --> 00:17:33.928
Emilia.

00:17:36.556 --> 00:17:39.267
Then, I'll give you a little reward.

00:17:41.727 --> 00:17:43.104
"Who am I?"

00:17:43.813 --> 00:17:46.482
What? Uh... A black bear?

00:17:46.941 --> 00:17:47.984
"Wrong!

00:17:48.109 --> 00:17:50.069
I'm Dark Chaos."

00:17:51.571 --> 00:17:52.822
"Well, what about me?"

00:17:54.782 --> 00:17:55.950
Mr. White Chaos!

00:17:56.158 --> 00:17:57.159
"Close.

00:17:57.243 --> 00:17:58.953
I'm a polar bear."

00:18:01.789 --> 00:18:03.332
Put them in here.

00:18:03.708 --> 00:18:05.126
And mix them together.

00:18:05.793 --> 00:18:07.420
White and black.

00:18:07.795 --> 00:18:09.547
White and black.

00:18:11.048 --> 00:18:12.216
What's in the box now?

00:18:14.135 --> 00:18:16.679
Schrödinger's... bear?

00:18:17.221 --> 00:18:18.222
Wrong!

00:18:19.056 --> 00:18:20.224
Hey! I can't see!

00:18:22.393 --> 00:18:23.394
Ta-da!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:26.147
It's a panda!

00:18:27.356 --> 00:18:28.733
Its name is Chaos.

00:18:31.027 --> 00:18:33.779
Open your ears even more.

00:18:34.989 --> 00:18:35.990
<i>More.</i>

00:18:36.657 --> 00:18:37.658
<i>More.</i>

00:18:40.536 --> 00:18:41.537
Welcome!

00:18:42.246 --> 00:18:43.873
Have a look at this, too.

00:18:47.752 --> 00:18:48.753
This shop?

00:18:49.545 --> 00:18:50.630
It's right nearby.

00:18:51.172 --> 00:18:53.132
OLD TOWN NEKOMUSUME RESTAURANT

00:18:55.551 --> 00:18:57.303
-What's--
-Don't ask. I'll kill you.

00:18:59.347 --> 00:19:00.473
You're late, brainiac.

00:19:00.931 --> 00:19:02.224
S-- Sorry.

00:19:03.059 --> 00:19:04.268
And the object?

00:19:04.769 --> 00:19:05.936
No doubt about it.

00:19:06.354 --> 00:19:07.188
It's inside.

00:19:07.521 --> 00:19:08.522
Good.

00:19:09.106 --> 00:19:11.525
We'll rush in when the deal starts.

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:17.990
For Neo Xianglong!

00:19:21.243 --> 00:19:22.536
Gren! Commander!

00:19:31.587 --> 00:19:32.588
A cyborg?

00:19:33.047 --> 00:19:34.048
No.

00:19:41.806 --> 00:19:42.807
Leon!

00:19:43.891 --> 00:19:44.892
Queenie!

00:19:46.018 --> 00:19:47.144
Damn monster!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:51.857
Chloe!

00:19:52.483 --> 00:19:53.317
Leon?

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:57.697
It's okay.

00:19:58.030 --> 00:19:59.031
Eliminating.

00:20:00.199 --> 00:20:01.200
Shit!

00:20:07.164 --> 00:20:08.374
I've failed.

00:20:14.422 --> 00:20:15.548
Where did he go?

00:20:16.006 --> 00:20:17.007
Stop!

00:20:17.299 --> 00:20:19.051
Leon! Leon!

00:20:19.343 --> 00:20:20.344
Chloe...

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.721
It's all right.

00:20:22.346 --> 00:20:23.764
It's all right now.

00:20:26.892 --> 00:20:28.227
Goddamn it.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:38.571
The rat managed to escape,
but it seems you've made a catch.

00:20:38.988 --> 00:20:42.742
This means we've got our hands
on a Dark Drive, pre-BRAI fusion?

00:20:43.242 --> 00:20:44.076
<i>That's right.</i>

00:20:45.411 --> 00:20:50.040
And this hand is a complete fusion
of living cells and machine.

00:20:50.791 --> 00:20:52.126
Is this a BRAI?

00:20:52.543 --> 00:20:54.754
<i>No, it's not a BRAI.</i>

00:20:55.129 --> 00:20:57.047
<i>But it's as close as one can get.</i>

00:20:57.715 --> 00:21:00.885
<i>I've never</i>
<i>seen this kind of technology.</i>

00:21:02.511 --> 00:21:04.930
<i>I'll begin the analyses right away.</i>
<i>Excuse me.</i>

00:21:06.474 --> 00:21:07.892
White Chaos...

00:21:08.684 --> 00:21:10.102
Dark Chaos...

00:21:11.061 --> 00:21:12.062
Fiona...

00:21:16.192 --> 00:21:18.027
I'm sorry for breaking the contract.

00:21:21.322 --> 00:21:23.157
I'm sorry for putting you in danger.

00:21:31.582 --> 00:21:32.583
Isn't this...

00:21:34.877 --> 00:21:37.713
Stones that deepen the bonds
with the person you love.

00:21:39.465 --> 00:21:41.258
I'm glad you weren't hurt, Chloe.

00:21:43.803 --> 00:21:44.887
Stupid Leon!

00:21:45.471 --> 00:21:47.515
<i>Stupid! Stupid, stupid, stupid!</i>

00:21:47.598 --> 00:21:49.850
<i>Don't, Chloe! Don't hit me so hard!</i>

00:21:51.894 --> 00:21:52.895
How cute.

00:23:25.487 --> 00:23:27.990
I'm surprised you knew it was that shop.

00:23:30.951 --> 00:23:32.453
An anti-BRAI round.

00:23:33.245 --> 00:23:35.247
Why did you have something so dangerous?

00:23:35.956 --> 00:23:38.000
Well, I was frightened.

00:23:40.002 --> 00:23:41.337
I thought I told you.

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:42.921
I'll do my job.

00:23:43.339 --> 00:23:44.548
And earn my pay.

00:23:46.884 --> 00:23:50.179
THE BLIND SPOT IN THE RAIN

00:23:50.262 --> 00:23:51.889
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
